      "title": "Part-Time CDL Bus & Van Driver",
      "description": "Posted: 2025-10-28\n\nLocation: Hastings\n\nJoin Our Team as a Bus & Van Driver at Hastings College! Hastings College is seeking a dedicated Bus & Van Driver to transport our students and employees to various events and activities. If you’re looking for a flexible, on-call position where you can make a difference, we want to hear from you! Why Hastings College? Flexible hours to fit your schedule Be part of a supportive and dynamic team Key Responsibilities: Safely operate college-owned or rented vehicles for scheduled trips Ensure timely and safe arrival at destinations Maintain vehicle cleanliness and conduct routine inspections See the attached job description for a full listing of essential duties.  What We’re Looking For: Valid driver’s license with acceptable motor vehicle record insurability in accordance with the Hasting’s College insurance plan.  CDL required (Class C with Passenger Endorsement) High school diploma or GED Experience driving buses or vans, ideally in an educational setting A commitment to safety and excellent customer service Evening and Weekend availability  Apply today and drive the future at Hastings College! Equal Opportunity Employment  Hastings College is committed to supporting a welcoming academic and employment environment. The College is an Equal Opportunity employer that does not discriminate on the basis of race, ethnicity, color, national origin, religion, age, sex, marital status, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by local, state, or federal laws. Applicants must be legally authorized to work in the United States. This position is not eligible for work visa sponsorship now or in the future.",
